  "description": "Han Ji-Han, the eldest son of South Korea’s most powerful chaebol family and the family’s black sheep, was heavily intoxicated again today. He returned home after receiving a call from his father for the first time in a long while, but all he found there were the bodies of his father and younger brother, and only the youngest son, Han Ji-Hun, still alive. The youngest son, who had been acting like a spoiled child just yesterday, pointed his finger at Han Ji-Han in front of a crowd of police officers, accusing him of the crime?!\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
